    "body": "I recently switched to Starship and very much experienced this, even as someone with a \"power prompt\".  The current Getting Started section of the docs is really a \"how to install\", and less of a \"how to get started\".  I found until I read the early sections of Configuration (in particular \"Format Strings\", which is fairly dense as an introduction) several times and then played with the options there I didn't really know what I was doing as I added things to my starship.toml.  Having some examples of recreating existing patterns from common Bash or Zsh prompts in starship I think would've helped. ",
